  6306c7b Look interned literals up in a direct-mapped cache first
  d53d1fc Call saturated closures directly from eco_apply_closure_eval
  7ffb6fa Snapshot String characters without a vector for short Strings
  4fec875 Compare pairs of unboxed numbers and Chars without the slot walk
  8ec2abe Keep a fused encoder loop's names inside the loop
  914603f Fuse sequence (List.map f xs) encoders without a length prefix

